{"parse": {"title": "打虎记-07", "pageid": 134671, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0-06\" title=\"打虎记-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">打虎记-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0-08\" title=\"打虎记-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">打虎记</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.86.89.E5.AE.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"醉宴\">醉宴</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 醉宴</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Celebration</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冬季的最后一场雪下了一天，今日终于放了晴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贫苦的乡村难得有次庆典娱乐，家家户户都聚到了胡朝奉的院子里，大口喝酒吃肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>据说这多亏了秀郎中从中斡旋——说是为了庆祝打虎，也给来年求个好收成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>让一让！咱们的小英雄来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>我敬你一杯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光一进院门，就被几个猎户举着酒碗堵住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>不必，我只是尽力而为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>客气什么！不喝就是瞧不起我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我不喜饮酒——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>干一杯，干一杯吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>就是，就是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中躲在一旁的廊柱后，悄悄笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>嗯，我告诉他们用此法戏弄，效果果然不错……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-622201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-622201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-622201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小女孩：</div><div>郎中！郎中！我肚子疼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个小女孩拉住她的衣角，眼泪汪汪地看着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中蹲下来，把了脉，在她手里塞了颗糖丸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>不是什么大事，你吃了这糖丸就好了。甜的，可好吃呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-622201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-622201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-622201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小女孩：</div><div>谢谢郎中！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中收回目光，抬头看见黑瓦边坐着个靛青色的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>这小子……就这么不爱热闹吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她搬来墙角的梯子，逐级攀上了屋檐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>唉，如今连房顶都要爬梯子上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……下面人太多了，本是我该做之事，不必这样谢来谢去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>但我仍不明白，那老虎怎会死而复生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>跳崖不死，倒也正常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>那老虎说不定是被什么神秘学力量控制了……或是被寄生了，或是成了某种无智的精怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我还听说很久之前有匹马跳到悬崖下，结果反而碰上大机缘——越过精怪，直接成仙了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……不要打趣我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中打开酒壶，盘坐在他身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我可是认真的。神秘学的事，谁说得清？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>总之，我是来提醒你。医馆连续三天没病人了，这不常见。你最好抓紧这个机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她右袖里空空荡荡，破了的衣摆还没补，倒显得有点落魄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光紧握着左手，不知在思考什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>怎么？下不了决心？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>投名状，哼……做官到底有什么好处，还不是为了更多的钱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>不是。我要用我的名字盖过父亲的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>某天清晨，他走出了家门，然后再没有回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>那之后，我们家就有了无尽的麻烦——甚至还被县民围过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……为什么不搬走？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>事发之后，很多族人都受不了流言蜚语，搬回了乡下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>“可我们决不能向那些人认输……也决不能逃避这污名。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>“不必理会那些闲言碎语，也不必在意那些落井下石的人。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我们终有一天会证明自己是清白的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风中传来乡民们的笑声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>哈哈，可你们本就是清白的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……这都是我的错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她闷了一口酒，声音沙哑起来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_02\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647205.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>那年死了太多人……但粮仓防守严密，没有内应很难成功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647205.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>是我去求程小弟。我说，我们只有几个人，只需要趁着换防，搬几袋粮食，拿几张银票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647205.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>他请个假，撇清关系。事后把罪责全推到我身上，拿盗匪肆虐把事情盖过去。影响不大，不会有人追着查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647205.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>他最多背个失察的过错。这是件顺手做了的好事……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>但那晚涌入的流民远不止几个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我不知道……我只是想救更多人。大家听说了这件事，都吵着要跟过来，给自家拿袋米。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我想，我自己能搬多少？不过是多带几个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我只是想救更多人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋下的人们勾肩搭背，闹成一团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那刚吃了肚痛药的小女孩，已经与伙伴们在庭院里追逐打闹。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_02\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647205.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>一进城是家商人的院子，有人看那青瓦白墙那么漂亮，就不肯走了。我着急搬粮，带着几个心腹先去了粮仓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647205.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……等我回来，事态已经无法控制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647205.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-647205.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647205.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>到处都是火，到处都有人在哭，我看见他们砸进了街边的房子，又抱着珠宝出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647204.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我说：“你们疯啦！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647204.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你们疯啦！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_4_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她哈哈大笑，喷出了一口酒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>他们说，我们在城外忍饥寒，奔道路，凭什么这些人就能在城内坐高堂，享美宴？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>就和我来水乡的第一天看到的一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……哈哈，是啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我拦下几个人，催促他们快走……我们还要回去发粮食呐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>但根本没人听我说话，他们平时都那么听话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>从此，我就觉得这些白房子是种邪恶的神秘术，要不怎么会诱人往死路走？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>他们最后全死了，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋檐下爆发出一阵喧闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>瞧瞧，我都说了我能打出火来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巨大的火焰从指尖蹿出，在庭院中央安静地燃烧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从屋顶俯视，火焰仿佛是在烤灼房屋；从屋顶俯视，火焰在每个人的脸上映出橘黄的暖光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年人骄傲地笑了，孩子们也笑了，老人们不赞成地皱皱眉。秀郎中丢掉酒壶，翻身站起，高声大笑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们听见嘹亮的笑声，纷纷抬头看向他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>烧吧！烧吧！把房子都烧了，把城墙都烧了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>房子都烧成黑色，肥沃的土壤里长出新的稻子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">严肃的家丁：</div><div>郎中，您说什么胡话呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>哈哈，郎中喝醉了！又演起将军来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>哎……别灭别灭——唉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰啪地熄灭了，四周的房屋回归原本的昏沉面貌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中重新坐下，向后躺倒在屋瓦上，似乎真是喝醉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>明日，我跟你走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光松开拳头，那枚铁梭子悬浮在他手掌以上三寸之处，隐隐可见斑斑血迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或许是因为那只诡异的老虎，锐意的效果并非消失，反而永久将梭子变成了一枚铁器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>骨梭子已经死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这里的人们还需要你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中间人：</div><div>程守备，这房子虽然比不上什么高门大户，可也是百年老屋，古雅清正！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中间人：</div><div>您看这墙——有年头了，还结实得很！老白了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644503.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644503.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>嗯。看了几回了，确实不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-644302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-644302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-644302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这很漂亮！就是有点窄……怕刀舞不开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>哈哈，还想着练武？真有志气，我们和光以后一定能做上武状元。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-644302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-644302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-644302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>而且离祠堂太近了，我膝盖还疼呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644503.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644503.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>还不是你淘气！况且，每天跪一个时辰也算罚跪吗——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>行了，没什么不好的。人也该知足，要个大院子住着干嘛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644503.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644503.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>也是，今天就签了地契吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中间人：</div><div>好嘞！好嘞！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-wuyunmibu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"wuyunmibu\"><img alt=\"wuyunmibu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-wuyunmibu.png/600px-Cg-wuyunmibu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-wuyunmibu.png/900px-Cg-wuyunmibu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Cg-wuyunmibu.png/1200px-Cg-wuyunmibu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中间人：</div><div>撒花了，撒花了！哎哟——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644503.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644503.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>和光！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中间人：</div><div>没事！小公子这神秘术可好——撒金花了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中间人：</div><div>恭贺乔迁之喜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-622920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中间人：</div><div>祝您家宅平安，人兴财旺，瑞气盈门，金玉满堂！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "打虎记-07"}}